OL,3,GNEWSASafety fears after 35 crashes on  
OL,4,Acity road                              
OL,6,FResidents and businesses are calling   
OL,7,Ffor safety improvements on a Birmingham
OL,8,Froad after dozens of crashes including 
OL,9,Fone recent fatal one.                  
OL,11,FCampaigners say there have been 35     
OL,12,Fcollisions on Stratford Road in Hall   
OL,13,FGreen over the past 40 months,         
OL,14,Fincluding one in September in which a  
OL,15,F68-year-old man died when he was hit by
OL,16,Fa vehicle.                             
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
