OL,3,GNEWSASafety fears after 35 crashes on  
OL,4,Acity road                              
OL,6,FLocal people were joined by            
OL,7,Fcouncillors, police and community      
OL,8,Fgroups for a road safety walkabout     
OL,9,Frecently, aimed at highlighting        
OL,10,Fconcerns about speeding, dangerous     
OL,11,Fdriving and parking problems.          
OL,13,FBirmingham City Council said           
OL,14,Faverage-speed cameras remained a       
OL,15,Fpriority for the route, with           
OL,16,Finstallation expected to begin in      
OL,17,Fspring 2027.                           
